## Title

[0.98a] [Pre-release] Political Map - Sector Map Layers

## Body

[center]
[img height=250]https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/Themes/core/images/post/question.gif[/img]

[color=maroon][size=30pt][b]Political Map[/b][/size][/color]
as the headline feature of [color=maroon][size=12pt][b]Sector Map Layers[/b][/size][/color]

[color=red][i]This is the [size=12pt][b]pre-release[/b][/size] stage intended for public testing and feedback collection.
You can try this mod early and share your experiences, so I can improve it.[/i][/color]
[hr]
Are you struggling to [b]keep track of faction presence and growth[/b]?
Do you want to know [b]which systems are claimed and by who[/b] before you even take the trip there?
Do you want to [b]paint the map[/b] with your conquests?
Or do you just want to [b]see all that border gore[/b] factions in your mod list produce?
[hr]
[url=https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMU/releases/latest][img]https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMU/total?style=for-the-badge&label=KMU[/img][/url]  [url=https://github.com][img]https://img.shields.io/badge/Install_with-TriOS-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=data%3Aimage%2Fsvg%2Bxml%3Bbase64%%%2BPHBhdGggZmlsbD0iIzUxODViYyIgZD0iTTE0Mi43ODMgNDMuNzgyYy0xLjA2Mi4yNS0yLjIwNC4yMDQtMy43NTkuMDM3Ljk1LS4xOTIgMi4zMTQtLjI2MiAzLjc1OS0uMDM3Ii8%2BPC9zdmc%2B[/img][/url]  [url=https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMU][img]https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMU?display_name=tag&sort=semver&style=for-the-badge&label=Source[/img][/url]
[url=https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMLib/releases/latest][img]https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMLib/total?style=for-the-badge&label=KMLib[/img][/url]  [url=https://github.com][img]https://img.shields.io/badge/Install_with-TriOS-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=data%3Aimage%2Fsvg%2Bxml%3Bbase64%%%2BPHBhdGggZmlsbD0iIzUxODViYyIgZD0iTTE0Mi43ODMgNDMuNzgyYy0xLjA2Mi4yNS0yLjIwNC4yMDQtMy43NTkuMDM3Ljk1LS4xOTIgMi4zMTQtLjI2MiAzLjc1OS0uMDM3Ii8%2BPC9zdmc%2B[/img][/url]  [url=https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMLib][img]https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMLib?display_name=tag&sort=semver&style=for-the-badge&label=Source[/img][/url]

This mod requires [url=https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=5444.0][b]LazyLib[/b][/url], [b][url=https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=25658.0]LunaLib[/url][/b], and [url=https://github.com/MagicLibStarsector/MagicLib/releases/]1.5.8-dev05 or newer[/url] of [url=https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=25868.0][b]MagicLib[/b][/url].
[hr]
It's [b][color=green]safe[/color] to install mid-run[/b],
and there's a short [b][color=green]uninstall procedure[/color][/b] you will need to follow if you decide to keep your save after uninstalling the mod.
[/center]
[hr]
[center]
This mod is made compatible with [b][url=https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=9175.0]Nexerelin[/url][/b], [b][url=https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=33870.0]Fast Rendering[/url][/b], [b][url=https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=26260.0]Random Assortment of Things[/url][/b].
[/center]
[hr]
[color=maroon][b]Sector Map Layers[/b][/color] is an overlay for the map screen [b](Tab, Q)[/b], the intel screen [b](E, 1)[/b], the minimap in the bottom right corner of the screen (replaces the vanilla radar) if you have [b]Random Assortment of Things[/b] installed.

